Homepage: https://www.nerdfonts.com/
Description: JetBrains Mono Nerd Font
 JetBrains Mono, the typeface by JetBrains, with the icons of Nerd Fonts
 patched in, from the Nerd Fonts release v@NERD_FONTS_VERSION@. It holds the
 families JetBrainsMono Nerd Font, with icons about one and a half letters
 wide, and JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono, with icons one letter wide, each in
 16 styles, in /usr/share/fonts/truetype/jetbrains-mono-nerd.
